{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711230/extras/cf2981eb08dad92857a64601a150fa9e.poster.avif?t=1768293463\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711230/extras/cf2981eb08dad92857a64601a150fa9e.webm?t=1768293463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711230/extras/cf2981eb08dad92857a64601a150fa9e.mp4?t=1768293463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slingshot Quest</strong> is a 3D turn-based RPG where you fight against ancient, oppressive powers using your magical Slingshot. Load up support spells to aid your own party, offensive spells to shoot at enemies, or use the Slingshot as a blunt weapon and attack 'em head-on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711230/extras/bd9e0ba254e620c8ac1997465f697117.poster.avif?t=1768293463\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711230/extras/bd9e0ba254e620c8ac1997465f697117.webm?t=1768293463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711230/extras/bd9e0ba254e620c8ac1997465f697117.mp4?t=1768293463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Charlie</strong>, a human boy unsatisfied with your role as a healer. Each day, the world's hatred grows stronger, and you know your species doesn't have much time left. You want to do everything in your power to protect those closest to you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your short trip to rescue your bird companion quickly turns into an ambitious quest to save the world, together with a rag-tag team of fellow fighters you meet along the way, human and non-human alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711230/extras/f94ae4a79e2ac8df1698d56e9a6d2d30.poster.avif?t=1768293463\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711230/extras/f94ae4a79e2ac8df1698d56e9a6d2d30.webm?t=1768293463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711230/extras/f94ae4a79e2ac8df1698d56e9a6d2d30.mp4?t=1768293463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Working your way up from barely surviving in an abandoned, small fortress to conquering the lairs of the <strong>Void Dragon</strong> Himself, you'll see yourself growing stronger and more capable with every battle won. Defeat enemies, search for loot, level-up your heroes, and upgrade your Stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slingshot Quest offers an approachable RPG experience with a gripping story, a unique, pseudo-retro artstyle, and fun, engaging gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Key art by Gjergji</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3711230?t=1768293463","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711230/6703a04c2f4d1c04abe02298ab11866187a9994a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768293463","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711230/162a506d6ca72d752208d901881905fa1d8bb894/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768293463","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711230/162a506d6ca72d752208d901881905fa1d8bb894/ca